          "num": 1,
          "title": "Membuat Group",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n\u2022 **Cara 1:** Pilih node (Shift+Klik) \u2192 Klik kanan \u2192 **Group**\n\u2022 **Cara 2:** Klik kanan canvas \u2192 **Add Group** \u2192 Seret node ke dalamnya\n\u2022 Group bisa diberi nama sesuai fungsinya",
          "color": "#ec4899",
          "bg": "#fdf2f8",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.06),0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04);background:#fff;border:1px solid #fbcfe8;overflow:hidden\"><div style=\"margin:6px;border:1.5px dashed #ec4899;border-radius:6px;padding:6px\"><div style=\"font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#db2777;margin-bottom:4px\">\ud83d\udcc1 Cek Amount</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:4px\"><span style=\"padding:3px 5px;border-radius:3px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:6px;color:#f59e0b\">CONSTANT > 50JT</span><span style=\"padding:3px 5px;border-radius:3px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:6px;color:#10b981\">CONTAINS FOREIGN</span></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
